# Backend

- Controllers thin; business logic in services; DI; DTOs + validation. No Prisma in controllers.
- HTTP envelope and error codes: `docs/api/conventions.md`. Routes: `docs/api/endpoints.md`.
- Ingest does not persist, roll up, or send alerts. Worker persist does not evaluate alerts.
- Structured JSON logs + `requestId`. See `docs/architecture/observability.md`.
- `$queryRaw` only with bound params.

```ts
// BAD — logic in controller, swallow errors
@Post('ingest') async ingest(@Body() body) { try { await this.prisma.event.create({ data: body }) } catch {} }

// GOOD — enqueue only; typed errors
@Post('ingest') ingest(@Body() dto: IngestDto) { return this.ingestion.accept(dto); }
```
